abstract: >-
  Executable recipes and SKILL.md patterns for engineering teams building governed
  AI applications on the SZL substrate. Includes knot-calculus-v1 (khipu receipt DAG
  with McAllester-1999 PAC-Bayes bound and TH11 knot-invariant verification),
  anatomy-evolved-v1 (8-organ anatomy with carlota-jo doctrine guards), and 9
  claude-code skills with HARVEST_LOG provenance.
